    {
      "id": "quiz-linear",
      "kind": "quiz",
      "headline": "线性结构小测验",
      "notes": "这个小测验旨在检验大家对线性结构的掌握程度。特别注意第3题关于循环队列的实现细节，这是同学们最容易出错的地方——很多人会忘记模运算在环形缓冲区中的关键作用。完成测验后我们将进入树结构的学习，你会发现很多树的操作其实可以看作是对线性结构操作的递归扩展。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "quiz",
          "kind": "objective",
          "stem": "在向量排序中，以下哪种算法在最坏情况下时间复杂度为 $O(n^2)$，但通过*三路划分*优化后能有效处理重复元素？",
          "choices": [
            {
              "key": "a",
              "text": "归并排序"
            },
            {
              "key": "b",
              "text": "快速排序"
            },
            {
              "key": "c",
              "text": "堆排序"
            }
          ],
          "answer": "b",
          "explain": "快速排序最坏情况(如已排序数组)为 $O(n^2)$，但其原地排序特性优于归并排序。三路划分将元素分为`<`/`=`/`>`基准值三部分，显著提升含重复数据时的效率。干扰项a的归并排序稳定为 $O(n\\log n)$ 但需额外空间。",
          "id": "bq1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-6",
      "kind": "section",
      "headline": "树结构进阶",
      "notes": "在上一页的小测验中，我们回顾了线性结构的特性。现在让我们思考：当数据间的关系不再是简单的前后相邻时，该如何组织数据？树结构就是解决这个问题的关键。这里要特别注意，虽然树看起来像'分叉的线性结构'，但其本质是半线性结构 - 每个节点可以有多个后继但只有一个前驱（根节点除外）。这是学生最容易混淆的概念之一。接下来我们将深入探讨最基础的树结构 - 二叉树。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "statement",
          "statement": "红黑树通过**颜色约束**和旋转操作，将搜索复杂度稳定在 $O(\\log n)$",
          "id": "sec6s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "binary-tree",
      "kind": "content",
      "eyebrow": "半线性结构",
      "headline": "二叉树",
      "lead": "二叉树是半线性结构的基础，具有递归性质。",
      "transition": "zoom",
      "notes": "同学们注意，这个二叉树图示中每个节点最多有两个子节点，这正是'二叉'的核心特征。常见误区是认为二叉树必须完全对称或每个节点都必须有两个子节点——实际上只要不超过两个即可，单子节点或叶子节点都是合法的。对比上一页的普通树结构，二叉树的约束条件更强但操作效率更高，这也为下一页要讲的二叉搜索树的高效查找特性埋下伏笔。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "diagramType": "cycle",
          "nodes": [
            {
              "title": "前序遍历",
              "sub": "根→左→右 (如 `A→B→D→E→C→F`)"
            },
            {
              "title": "中序遍历",
              "sub": "左→根→右 (如 `D→B→E→A→F→C`)"
            },
            {
              "title": "后序遍历",
              "sub": "左→右→根 (如 `D→E→B→F→C→A`)"
            },
            {
              "title": "层序遍历",
              "sub": "按深度逐层访问 (如 `A→B→C→D→E→F`)"
            }
          ],
          "id": "b10"
        },
        {
          "type": "sim",
          "engine": "widget",
          "html": "<style>\n  .widget {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    height: 100%;\n    gap: 16px;\n    padding: 16px;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n  }\n  .controls {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  button {\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    background: var(--card);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 150ms ease;\n  }\n  button:hover {\n    background: var(--bg2);\n  }\n  button:active {\n    transform: translateY(1px);\n  }\n  select {\n    padding: 6px;\n    background: var(--card);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n  }\n  .stage {\n    flex: 1;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n  .node {\n    fill: var(--card);\n    stroke: var(--line);\n    stroke-width: 1.5;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 150ms ease;\n  }\n  .node.active {\n    fill: var(--accent);\n    stroke: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .edge {\n    stroke: var(--line);\n    stroke-width: 1.5;\n    fill: none;\n  }\n  .edge.active {\n    stroke: var(--accent);\n    stroke-width: 2;\n  }\n  .label {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    fill: var(--ink);\n    text-anchor: middle;\n    dominant-baseline: central;\n  }\n  .hint {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 8px;\n    left: 8px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    background: var(--card);\n    padding: 4px 8px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"widget\">\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <select id=\"order\">\n      <option value=\"pre\">前序遍历</option>\n      <option value=\"in\">中序遍历</option>\n      <option value=\"post\">后序遍历</option>\n    </select>\n    <button id=\"next\">下一步</button>\n    <button id=\"reset\">重置</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stage\">\n    <div class=\"hint\" id=\"hint\">前序第一步：访问根</div>\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" id=\"tree\">\n      <!-- Nodes will be generated here -->\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const treeData = [5,3,7,2,4,6,8];\n  let traversalType = 'pre';\n  let currentStep = 0;\n  let highlightPath = [];\n\n  const svg = document.getElementById('tree');\n  const orderSelect = document.getElementById('order');\n  const nextBtn = document.getElementById('next');\n  const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n  const hint = document.getElementById('hint');\n\n  // Initialize tree\n  function initTree() {\n    svg.innerHTML = '';\n    \n    // Calculate positions\n    const nodePositions = {};\n    const levelHeight = 80;\n    const rootX = 200;\n    const rootY = 50;\n    \n    // Position nodes (simple binary tree layout)\n    const positionNode = (value, index, x, y, level) => {\n      nodePositions[value] = { x, y };\n      const leftIndex = 2 * index + 1;\n      const rightIndex = 2 * index + 2;\n      const xOffset = 100 / (level + 1);\n      \n      if (leftIndex < treeData.length) {\n        positionNode(treeData[leftIndex], leftIndex, x - xOffset, y + levelHeight, level + 1);\n      }\n      if (rightIndex < treeData.length) {\n        positionNode(treeData[rightIndex], rightIndex, x + xOffset, y + levelHeight, level + 1);\n      }\n    };\n    \n    positionNode(treeData[0], 0, rootX, rootY, 1);\n    \n    // Draw edges first (so nodes appear on top)\n    for (let i = 0; i < treeData.length; i++) {\n      const value = treeData[i];\n      const leftIndex = 2 * i + 1;\n      const rightIndex = 2 * i + 2;\n      \n      if (leftIndex < treeData.length) {\n        const leftValue = treeData[leftIndex];\n        const edge = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');\n        edge.setAttribute('d', `M${nodePositions[value].x},${nodePositions[value].y} L${nodePositions[leftValue].x},${nodePositions[leftValue].y}`);\n        edge.classList.add('edge');\n        edge.id = `edge-${value}-${leftValue}`;\n        svg.appendChild(edge);\n      }\n      \n      if (rightIndex < treeData.length) {\n        const rightValue = treeData[rightIndex];\n        const edge = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');\n        edge.setAttribute('d', `M${nodePositions[value].x},${nodePositions[value].y} L${nodePositions[rightValue].x},${nodePositions[rightValue].y}`);\n        edge.classList.add('edge');\n        edge.id = `edge-${value}-${rightValue}`;\n        svg.appendChild(edge);\n      }\n    }\n    \n    // Draw nodes\n    for (const value in nodePositions) {\n      const { x, y } = nodePositions[value];\n      const node = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'circle');\n      node.setAttribute('cx', x);\n      node.setAttribute('cy', y);\n      node.setAttribute('r', 15);\n      node.classList.add('node');\n      node.id = `node-${value}`;\n      svg.appendChild(node);\n      \n      const label = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text');\n      label.setAttribute('x', x);\n      label.setAttribute('y', y);\n      label.classList.add('label');\n      label.textContent = value;\n      svg.appendChild(label);\n    }\n    \n    update();\n  }\n\n  // Generate traversal order\n  function getTraversalOrder(type) {\n    const order = [];\n    \n    function traverse(index) {\n      if (index >= treeData.length) return;\n      \n      if (type === 'pre') order.push(treeData[index]);\n      traverse(2 * index + 1);\n      if (type === 'in') order.push(treeData[index]);\n      traverse(2 * index + 2);\n      if (type === 'post') order.push(treeData[index]);\n    }\n    \n    traverse(0);\n    return order;\n  }\n\n  // Update visualization\n  function update() {\n    // Reset all highlights\n    document.querySelectorAll('.node, .edge').forEach(el => {\n      el.classList.remove('active');\n    });\n    \n    const traversalOrder = getTraversalOrder(traversalType);\n    if (currentStep >= traversalOrder.length) return;\n    \n    const currentValue = traversalOrder[currentStep];\n    highlightPath = [currentValue];\n    \n    // Highlight current node\n    const currentNode = document.getElementById(`node-${currentValue}`);\n    if (currentNode) currentNode.classList.add('active');\n    \n    // Highlight path to root\n    let index = treeData.indexOf(currentValue);\n    while (index > 0) {\n      const parentIndex = Math.floor((index - 1) / 2);\n      const parentValue = treeData[parentIndex];\n      const edge = document.getElementById(`edge-${parentValue}-${currentValue}`) || \n                   document.getElementById(`edge-${currentValue}-${parentValue}`);\n      if (edge) edge.classList.add('active');\n      \n      const parentNode = document.getElementById(`node-${parentValue}`);\n      if (parentNode) parentNode.classList.add('active');\n      \n      highlightPath.push(parentValue);\n      currentValue = parentValue;\n      index = parentIndex;\n    }\n    \n    // Update hint\n    const typeNames = { pre: '前序', in: '中序', post: '后序' };\n    hint.textContent = `${typeNames[traversalType]}第${currentStep + 1}步：访问节点${traversalOrder[currentStep]}`;\n  }\n\n  // Event listeners\n  orderSelect.addEventListener('change', () => {\n    traversalType = orderSelect.value;\n    currentStep = 0;\n    update();\n  });\n\n  nextBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const traversalOrder = getTraversalOrder(traversalType);\n    if (currentStep < traversalOrder.length - 1) {\n      currentStep++;\n      update();\n    }\n  });\n\n  resetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    currentStep = 0;\n    update();\n  });\n\n  // Initialize\n  initTree();\n</script>",
          "id": "b11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bst",
      "kind": "content",
      "headline": "二叉搜索树",
      "lead": "二叉搜索树通过有序性实现高效查找。",
      "notes": "二叉搜索树的关键在于其有序性：左子树所有节点值小于根节点，右子树所有节点值大于根节点。这个性质使得查找、插入和删除的平均时间复杂度为O(log n)。常见误区是认为所有操作都一定是O(log n)，实际上在极端情况下（如插入有序序列）会退化为O(n)的链表。下一节我们将学习AVL树和红黑树如何通过平衡性来避免这种退化。",
