    {
      "id": "avl-rbt",
      "kind": "content",
      "headline": "AVL树与红黑树",
      "lead": "平衡二叉搜索树通过旋转操作维持平衡性。",
      "notes": "同学们注意，AVL树和红黑树虽然都是平衡二叉搜索树，但它们的平衡策略有本质区别。AVL树通过严格的平衡因子（左右子树高度差不超过1）来保证平衡，而红黑树则通过颜色标记和5条规则实现近似平衡。这里常见的误区是认为红黑树是完全平衡的，实际上它的平衡性比AVL树稍弱，但维护成本更低。从上一页的普通二叉搜索树过渡到这两种自平衡结构，我们看到通过不同方式解决了树退化的关键问题。接下来我们要讨论的哈希表，将采用完全不同的思路来处理数据存储问题。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "compare",
          "left": {
            "caption": "AVL 树",
            "block": {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "严格平衡：任一节点左右子树高度差 ≤ 1"
                },
                {
                  "text": "插入/删除后最多需 $O(\\log n)$ 次旋转调整"
                },
                {
                  "text": "适用场景：查询密集型（如数据库索引）"
                },
                {
                  "text": "示例：插入 `3→2→1` 触发右旋"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "right": {
            "caption": "红黑树",
            "block": {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "弱平衡：黑高相同，最长路径 ≤ 2 倍最短路径"
                },
                {
                  "text": "插入/删除最多需 2 次旋转 + $O(1)$ 次变色"
                },
                {
                  "text": "适用场景：频繁更新（如 Linux 进程调度）"
                },
                {
                  "text": "示例：插入 `41→38→31→12` 触发双红修正"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "id": "b14"
        },
        {
          "type": "sim",
          "engine": "widget",
          "html": "<style>\n  .widget {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    height: 100%;\n    gap: 16px;\n    padding: 16px;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n  }\n  .controls {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  button {\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    background: var(--card);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 150ms ease;\n  }\n  button:hover {\n    background: var(--bg2);\n  }\n  button:active {\n    transform: translateY(1px);\n  }\n  input[type=\"range\"] {\n    flex: 1;\n    accent-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .mono {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  }\n  .status {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    padding: 8px;\n    background: var(--bg2);\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n  }\n  svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    flex: 1;\n    background: var(--card);\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n  }\n  .node {\n    transition: all 200ms ease;\n  }\n  .node.highlight {\n    stroke: var(--accent);\n    stroke-width: 2px;\n  }\n  .node-text {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    text-anchor: middle;\n    dominant-baseline: middle;\n    fill: white;\n  }\n  .path {\n    stroke: var(--line);\n    stroke-width: 1.5;\n  }\n  .path.highlight {\n    stroke: var(--accent);\n    stroke-width: 2;\n  }\n  .arrow {\n    stroke: var(--accent);\n    stroke-width: 1.5;\n    marker-end: url(#arrowhead);\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"widget\">\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <input type=\"number\" id=\"insertValue\" min=\"1\" max=\"99\" value=\"50\" class=\"mono\" style=\"width: 60px;\">\n    <button id=\"insert\">插入节点</button>\n    <button id=\"next\">下一步</button>\n    <div class=\"status mono\" id=\"status\">步骤1: 检查父节点颜色</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <label for=\"speed\">动画速度</label>\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"speed\" min=\"100\" max=\"1000\" value=\"400\">\n  </div>\n  \n  <svg id=\"tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\">\n    <defs>\n      <marker id=\"arrowhead\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n        <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"var(--accent)\"/>\n      </marker>\n    </defs>\n  </svg>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const state = {\n    treeData: [\n      { id: 30, value: 30, color: 'black', left: null, right: null, parent: null, x: 400, y: 50 },\n      { id: 20, value: 20, color: 'black', left: null, right: null, parent: 30, x: 300, y: 150 },\n      { id: 40, value: 40, color: 'black', left: null, right: null, parent: 30, x: 500, y: 150 },\n      { id: 10, value: 10, color: 'red', left: null, right: null, parent: 20, x: 250, y: 250 },\n      { id: 25, value: 25, color: 'red', left: null, right: null, parent: 20, x: 350, y: 250 }\n    ],\n    insertValue: 50,\n    highlightPath: [4],\n    currentStep: 1,\n    speed: 400\n  };\n\n  const svg = document.getElementById('tree');\n  const insertBtn = document.getElementById('insert');\n  const nextBtn = document.getElementById('next');\n  const speedSlider = document.getElementById('speed');\n  const statusEl = document.getElementById('status');\n  const insertValueEl = document.getElementById('insertValue');\n\n  function update() {\n    // Clear SVG\n    while (svg.childNodes.length > 1) {\n      svg.removeChild(svg.lastChild);\n    }\n\n    // Draw paths first (so nodes appear on top)\n    state.treeData.forEach(node => {\n      if (node.parent) {\n        const parent = state.treeData.find(n => n.id === node.parent);\n        if (parent) {\n          const path = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');\n          path.setAttribute('d', `M${parent.x},${parent.y} L${node.x},${node.y}`);\n          path.classList.add('path');\n          if (state.highlightPath.includes(node.id) || state.highlightPath.includes(parent.id)) {\n            path.classList.add('highlight');\n          }\n          svg.appendChild(path);\n        }\n      }\n    });\n\n    // Draw nodes\n    state.treeData.forEach(node => {\n      const circle = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'circle');\n      circle.setAttribute('cx', node.x);\n      circle.setAttribute('cy', node.y);\n      circle.setAttribute('r', 20);\n      circle.classList.add('node');\n      circle.setAttribute('fill', node.color === 'red' ? '#ef4444' : '#1e293b');\n      if (state.highlightPath.includes(node.id)) {\n        circle.classList.add('highlight');\n      }\n      svg.appendChild(circle);\n\n      const text = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text');\n      text.setAttribute('x', node.x);\n      text.setAttribute('y', node.y);\n      text.classList.add('node-text');\n      text.textContent = node.value;\n      svg.appendChild(text);\n    });\n\n    // Update status text\n    const steps = [\n      \"步骤1: 检查父节点颜色\",\n      \"步骤2: 检查叔叔节点颜色\",\n      \"步骤3: 重新着色\",\n      \"步骤4: 执行旋转\",\n      \"步骤5: 完成插入\"\n    ];\n    statusEl.textContent = steps[state.currentStep - 1];\n  }\n\n  function insertNode(value) {\n    // Find insertion point\n    let newNode = { \n      id: Date.now(), \n      value: parseInt(value), \n      color: 'red', \n      left: null, \n      right: null, \n      parent: null,\n      x: 0,\n      y: 0\n    };\n    \n    if (state.treeData.length === 0) {\n      newNode.color = 'black';\n      newNode.x = 400;\n      newNode.y = 50;\n      state.treeData.push(newNode);\n    } else {\n      let current = state.treeData[0];\n      while (true) {\n        if (newNode.value < current.value) {\n          if (current.left === null) {\n            current.left = newNode.id;\n            newNode.parent = current.id;\n            newNode.x = current.x - 100;\n            newNode.y = current.y + 100;\n            break;\n          } else {\n            current = state.treeData.find(n => n.id === current.left);\n          }\n        } else {\n          if (current.right === null) {\n            current.right = newNode.id;\n            newNode.parent = current.id;\n            newNode.x = current.x + 100;\n            newNode.y = current.y + 100;\n            break;\n          } else {\n            current = state.treeData.find(n => n.id === current.right);\n          }\n        }\n      }\n      state.treeData.push(newNode);\n    }\n    \n    // Set highlight path from new node to root\n    state.highlightPath = [newNode.id];\n    let parentId = newNode.parent;\n    while (parentId) {\n      state.highlightPath.push(parentId);\n      const parent = state.treeData.find(n => n.id === parentId);\n      parentId = parent ? parent.parent : null;\n    }\n    \n    state.currentStep = 1;\n    update();\n  }\n\n  function nextStep() {\n    if (state.currentStep < 5) {\n      state.currentStep++;\n      \n      // Simulate some changes for demo\n      if (state.currentStep === 3) {\n        // Recolor\n        const node = state.treeData.find(n => n.id === state.highlightPath[0]);\n        if (node) {\n          node.color = 'black';\n          const parent = state.treeData.find(n => n.id === node.parent);\n          if (parent) parent.color = 'red';\n        }\n      } else if (state.currentStep === 4) {\n        // Rotate (just move positions for demo)\n        const node = state.treeData.find(n => n.id === state.highlightPath[0]);\n        if (node) {\n          node.x += 50;\n          node.y -= 50;\n        }\n      }\n      \n      update();\n    }\n  }\n\n  insertBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    insertNode(insertValueEl.value);\n  });\n\n  nextBtn.addEventListener('click', nextStep);\n\n  speedSlider.addEventListener('input', (e) => {\n    state.speed = parseInt(e.target.value);\n    svg.style.transitionDuration = `${state.speed}ms`;\n  });\n\n  // Initial render\n  update();\n</script>",
          "id": "b15"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hash-table",
